# This repository vendors upstream FLTK headers and the go-fltk wrapper
# sources, and is maintained as a rebased stack of local commits on top of
# upstream. Git's line-ending normalisation (core.autocrlf=input) rewrites
# CRLF to LF in every file it stages, which silently turns a small edit into
# a whole-file diff and makes each rebase conflict on files we never meant to
# touch. Disable all text conversion so committed bytes match upstream's.
* -text
